{"posts":[{"id":"pg_p2_26","t":"Some more learning and refining of RTM concepts.","a":"prosenjitghosh","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#26","p":2,"im":["7a43a525a4a439108ec42a6a40e0df8482cf0e74"],"fa":"ادامهٔ یادگیری و دقیق‌تر کردن درکم از مفاهیم RTM.","ib":{"7a43a525a4a439108ec42a6a40e0df8482cf0e74":1},"m":26},{"id":"pg_p2_27","t":"Planning a trade in a QM supply, let's see how it works.","a":"prosenjitghosh","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#27","p":2,"im":["83dbd008d092a3504f8d8e5ca61f48060526118a"],"fa":"برنامه‌ریزی یک معامله در عرضهٔ QM، ببینیم چطور جواب می‌دهد.","ib":{"83dbd008d092a3504f8d8e5ca61f48060526118a":1},"m":27},{"id":"pg_p2_28","t":"Planning another trade based on newly formed QM over a Monthly demand. let's see how it works works.","a":"prosenjitghosh","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#28","p":2,"im":["d50b10b3bb4a1e4883736adff56632c2321dce26"],"fa":"برنامه‌ریزی یک معاملهٔ دیگر بر اساس QM تازه‌شکل‌گرفته روی یک تقاضای ماهانه. ببینیم چطور کار می‌کند.","ib":{"d50b10b3bb4a1e4883736adff56632c2321dce26":1},"m":28},{"id":"pg_p2_29","t":"prosenjitghosh wrote: Planning another trade based on newly formed QM over a Monthly demand. let's see how it works works.\n\nStopped Out in this trade. Price gave a small bounce and then a big fall. Also broke the Monthly demand.","a":"prosenjitghosh","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#29","p":2,"im":["d50b10b3bb4a1e4883736adff56632c2321dce26"],"fa":"prosenjitghosh نوشت: برنامه‌ریزی یک معاملهٔ دیگر بر اساس QM تازه‌شکل‌گرفته روی یک تقاضای ماهانه. ببینیم چطور کار می‌کند.\n\nدر این معامله استاپ خوردم. قیمت یک بازگشت کوچک داد و بعد یک ریزش بزرگ. تقاضای ماهانه را هم شکست.","ib":{"d50b10b3bb4a1e4883736adff56632c2321dce26":1},"m":29},{"id":"pg_p2_30","t":"Another QM trade, Full target achieved.. QM was in 60 mins chart,so took a Hourly Income Trade and achieved 5:1. Decision points also worked out.","a":"prosenjitghosh","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#30","p":2,"im":["bef50764112dcfca656ae213cb6088183e532d90","1d456080fb82d25ffc817dd477e848168917c041"],"fa":"یک معاملهٔ دیگر بر اساس QM؛ تارگت به‌طور کامل محقق شد. QM در چارت 60 دقیقه‌ای بود، بنابراین یک معاملهٔ درآمد ساعتی انجام دادم و به نسبت 5:1 رسیدم. نقاط تصمیم نیز به‌خوبی عمل کردند.","m":30},{"id":"pg_p2_31","t":"Just a thought. Nifty Analysis on Daily Chart, mixing RTM concepts with Candle Stick Patterns. Will observe this..","a":"prosenjitghosh","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#31","p":2,"im":["e5a0f95cc078fd6291b675b271f889ff47efaf07"],"fa":"صرفاً یک ایده است. تحلیل Nifty در چارت روزانه با ترکیب مفاهیم RTM و الگوهای کندلی. روند آن را دنبال خواهم کرد…","ib":{"e5a0f95cc078fd6291b675b271f889ff47efaf07":1},"m":31},{"id":"pg_p2_32","t":"prosenjitghosh wrote: Another QM trade, Full target achieved.. QM was in 60 mins chart,so took a Hourly Income Trade and achieved 5:1. Decision points also worked out.\n\nAnalysing the Decision Points of this trade in a M5.","a":"prosenjitghosh","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#32","p":2,"im":["bef50764112dcfca656ae213cb6088183e532d90","9b74f5cdcecfb9371478bc16f759d73b82c2cdc2"],"fa":"prosenjitghosh نوشت: یک معاملهٔ دیگر بر اساس QM؛ تارگت به‌طور کامل محقق شد. QM در چارت 60 دقیقه‌ای بود، بنابراین یک معاملهٔ درآمد ساعتی انجام دادم و به نسبت 5:1 رسیدم. نقاط تصمیم نیز به‌خوبی عمل کردند.\n\nتحلیل نقطه‌های تصمیم این معامله در M5.","ib":{"bef50764112dcfca656ae213cb6088183e532d90":1,"9b74f5cdcecfb9371478bc16f759d73b82c2cdc2":2},"m":32},{"id":"pg_p2_33","t":"Back to Back QM's in Infy. Clear distribution is happening, Institutions are filling their sell order's.","a":"prosenjitghosh","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#33","p":2,"im":["e1fbf08fa4ecec4cbb62cdb4655fd43d25ec13d9"],"fa":"QM‌های پشت‌سرهم در Infy. توزیع واضحی در جریان است، نهادها دارند سفارش‌های فروششان را پر می‌کنند.","ib":{"e1fbf08fa4ecec4cbb62cdb4655fd43d25ec13d9":1},"m":33},{"id":"pg_p2_34","t":"Decision Points. Understanding HTF versus LTF zones. Daily Chart\n\n60 Mins Chart","a":"prosenjitghosh","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#34","p":2,"im":["442cb92efc88152bac95e8cf7772376a35fdc87c","7e439f0ecb6379a8b7d29b7c0496648fb6e6e407"],"fa":"نقاط تصمیم. شناخت نواحی تایم‌فریم بالاتر در مقایسه با تایم‌فریم پایین‌تر. چارت روزانه\n\nچارت 60 دقیقه‌ای","ib":{"442cb92efc88152bac95e8cf7772376a35fdc87c":1,"7e439f0ecb6379a8b7d29b7c0496648fb6e6e407":2},"m":34},{"id":"pg_p2_35","t":"QM, 3 Drive, Compression.","a":"prosenjitghosh","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#35","p":2,"im":["c1a382c54fcd41468bd3388c512284ada25b0666"],"fa":"QM، 3 درایو، فشردگی.","ib":{"c1a382c54fcd41468bd3388c512284ada25b0666":1},"m":35},{"id":"pg_p2_36","t":"Price Action and Future movement.","a":"prosenjitghosh","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#36","p":2,"im":["2a7d3535e69a45e2f341734c8ea6c00f5db090db"],"fa":"PA و حرکت آینده.","ib":{"2a7d3535e69a45e2f341734c8ea6c00f5db090db":1},"m":36},{"id":"pg_p2_37","t":"","a":"prosenjitghosh","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#37","p":2,"im":["8e3fb0f2e30a54fefc6ee64458ab3cee0059a372"],"ib":{"8e3fb0f2e30a54fefc6ee64458ab3cee0059a372":0},"m":37},{"id":"pg_p2_38","t":"Why engulf/Fakeouts are so important. Even an engulf of a Minor SR can give you huge returns.","a":"prosenjitghosh","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#38","p":2,"im":["85a0c354d0095aa08fe1b3075ea2fb1e3f78fd1e"],"fa":"چرا اینگالف/فیک‌اوت‌ها این‌قدر مهم‌اند؟ حتی اینگالف یک SR فرعی هم می‌تواند بازدهی بسیار زیادی داشته باشد.","ib":{"85a0c354d0095aa08fe1b3075ea2fb1e3f78fd1e":1},"m":38},{"id":"pg_p2_39","t":"prosenjitghosh wrote: Just a thought. Nifty Analysis on Daily Chart, mixing RTM concepts with Candle Stick Patterns. Will observe this..\n\nAn Update on the same.","a":"prosenjitghosh","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#39","p":2,"im":["e5a0f95cc078fd6291b675b271f889ff47efaf07","6570bbaba977a44f57e3e16b1b36a4c0f8056111"],"fa":"prosenjitghosh نوشت: صرفاً یک ایده است. تحلیل Nifty در چارت روزانه با ترکیب مفاهیم RTM و الگوهای کندلی. روند آن را دنبال خواهم کرد…\n\nیک به‌روزرسانی دربارهٔ همان.","ib":{"e5a0f95cc078fd6291b675b271f889ff47efaf07":1,"6570bbaba977a44f57e3e16b1b36a4c0f8056111":2},"m":39},{"id":"pg_p2_40","t":"SR FLIP","a":"prosenjitghosh","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#40","p":2,"im":["091039b75dc70207e6b2a4f7f0ba64a588318cde"],"ib":{"091039b75dc70207e6b2a4f7f0ba64a588318cde":1},"m":40},{"id":"pg_p2_41","t":"FL's created at the Breakout point's of a Flag are wonderful places to take high probability trades.","a":"prosenjitghosh","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#41","p":2,"im":["1a7273bdc9e44d5bcbdc623d6d0d63954b7b2374"],"fa":"FL‌هایی که در نقاط شکست یک فلگ شکل می‌گیرند، نواحی بسیار مناسبی برای ورود به معاملات با احتمال موفقیت بالا هستند.","ib":{"1a7273bdc9e44d5bcbdc623d6d0d63954b7b2374":1},"m":41},{"id":"pg_p2_42","t":"Diamond in Nifty","a":"prosenjitghosh","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#42","p":2,"im":["cce08b7d772a9bf9ebec8200f3fb26d7298eddc8"],"fa":"الگوی الماس در Nifty","ib":{"cce08b7d772a9bf9ebec8200f3fb26d7298eddc8":1},"m":42}],"images":[{"k":"7a43a525a4a439108ec42a6a40e0df8482cf0e74","t":"assets/thumbs/7a43a525a4a439108ec42a6a40e0df8482cf0e74.webp","f":"assets/images/7a43a525a4a439108ec42a6a40e0df8482cf0e74.webp","w":1366,"h":738,"b":91866,"o":"7a43a525a4a439108ec42a6a40e0df8482cf0e74.jpeg","p":2,"pid":"pg_p2_26"},{"k":"83dbd008d092a3504f8d8e5ca61f48060526118a","t":"assets/thumbs/83dbd008d092a3504f8d8e5ca61f48060526118a.webp","f":"assets/images/83dbd008d092a3504f8d8e5ca61f48060526118a.webp","w":1800,"h":972,"b":126970,"o":"83dbd008d092a3504f8d8e5ca61f48060526118a.jpeg","p":2,"pid":"pg_p2_27"},{"k":"d50b10b3bb4a1e4883736adff56632c2321dce26","t":"assets/thumbs/d50b10b3bb4a1e4883736adff56632c2321dce26.webp","f":"assets/images/d50b10b3bb4a1e4883736adff56632c2321dce26.webp","w":1800,"h":972,"b":139668,"o":"d50b10b3bb4a1e4883736adff56632c2321dce26.jpeg","p":2,"pid":"pg_p2_29"},{"k":"bef50764112dcfca656ae213cb6088183e532d90","t":"assets/thumbs/bef50764112dcfca656ae213cb6088183e532d90.webp","f":"assets/images/bef50764112dcfca656ae213cb6088183e532d90.webp","w":1185,"h":634,"b":59232,"o":"bef50764112dcfca656ae213cb6088183e532d90.jpeg","p":2,"pid":"pg_p2_32"},{"k":"1d456080fb82d25ffc817dd477e848168917c041","t":"assets/thumbs/1d456080fb82d25ffc817